<title>POLAND: POLISH C.BANK OFFERS PLN 300 MLN OF 273-DAY BILLS.</title>
<headline>POLISH C.BANK OFFERS PLN 300 MLN OF 273-DAY BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland offered to sell 300 million zlotys worth of its 273-day bills at a tender for banks which have money market dealer status.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
